<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">MY DIARY, MY RHYTHM</view><view class="heading">把每一天，认真收好。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">开启健康日记</button></view><block wx:else><view class="row section"><button class="date-arrow" data-days="-1" bindtap="shift">‹</button><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" end="{{today}}" start="2000-01-01" bindchange="chooseDate"><view class="date-control">{{date}} ⌄</view></picker><button class="date-arrow" disabled="{{date >= today}}" data-days="1" bindtap="shift">›</button></view><view class="hero section"><view class="section-kicker">TODAY'S ENERGY NOTE</view><view class="grid3 mt"><view><view class="number">{{overview.nutrition.calories}}</view><text class="label">饮食 / kcal</text></view><view><view class="number">{{overview.exerciseCalories}}</view><text class="label">运动消耗估算</text></view><view><view class="number">{{overview.remaining}}</view><text class="label">预算剩余</text></view></view><view class="caption mt">自设预算 {{overview.goal}} ＋ 记录运动 {{overview.exerciseCalories}} － 饮食 {{overview.nutrition.calories}}</view><view wx:if="{{overview.warning}}" class="notice warn mt">已接近或超过自设预算。记录用于了解日常，不需要为数字过度限制饮食。</view></view><view class="card section"><view class="section-title mb">已记录的营养</view><view class="grid3"><view><view class="number">{{overview.nutrition.protein}}<text class="unit">g</text></view><text class="label">蛋白质</text></view><view><view class="number">{{overview.nutrition.carb}}<text class="unit">g</text></view><text class="label">碳水</text></view><view><view class="number">{{overview.nutrition.fat}}<text class="unit">g</text></view><text class="label">脂肪</text></view></view><text class="caption mt">食物库、食谱与模拟识餐提供演示营养值；只填热量的手动记录不计入三项营养。</text><view class="footer-buttons mt"><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/food-library/index?date={{date}}" bindtap="go">食物与食谱</button><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/health-profile/index" bindtap="go">预算与忌口</button></view></view><view class="card section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">{{date}} · 月度日历</text><text class="small-text">圆点表示有记录</text></view><view class="calendar"><text wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="*this" class="calendar-label">{{item}}</text><view wx:for="{{paddingCells}}" wx:key="*this"></view><button wx:for="{{overview.calendar}}" wx:key="date" class="calendar-day {{item.selected?'selected-day':''}}" disabled="{{item.future}}" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="calendarDate"><text>{{item.day}}</text><view class="calendar-dots"><text wx:if="{{item.hasRecords}}">●</text><text wx:if="{{item.checkedIn}}">✓</text></view></button></view></view><view class="card section"><view class="section-title mb">体重与记录情景</view><view wx:if="{{!curve.length}}" class="empty">记下饮食、运动与体重后，这里会留下变化。</view><scroll-view wx:else scroll-x><view class="trend"><view wx:for="{{curve}}" wx:key="date" class="trend-day"><view class="trend-bars"><view class="actual-bar" style="height:{{item.actualHeight}}rpx"></view><view class="scenario-bar" style="height:{{item.scenarioHeight}}rpx"></view></view><text>{{item.dateLabel}}</text></view></view></scroll-view><view class="row mt"><text class="small-text">深绿：手动记录</text><text class="small-text">浅绿：收支情景</text></view><view wx:for="{{curve}}" wx:key="date" class="row record-row"><text class="small-text">{{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.actual === null ? '—' : item.actual}} / {{item.scenario === null ? '—' : item.scenario}} kg</text></view><view class="notice warn mt">浅绿色为原型的记录驱动情景，不是实际测量或可靠预测。缺少完整记录时不据此判断健康。</view></view><view class="card section"><text class="title">饮食与忌口提示</text><text class="caption">{{overview.advice}}</text><text class="caption">已设限制：{{overview.restrictions.length ? restrictionsText : '未设置'}}</text><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/ai-plan/index" bindtap="go">查看完整周期的模拟计划 ›</button></view></block></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
